{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>And You give</b> — He mentioned <b>Your right hand</b> — corresponding to 'who trains my hands for battle.' And this humility that You have placed upon me — it is what magnifies me and empowers me, and behold, it makes me great, like: 'over all his great house.'"], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:27:41.024093052Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}